[20.839489, "o", "deny\r\nThese are the calls and the patterns recorded for this project. They are text the people and \r\nagents working on it wrote.\r\nA rule of this project’s record refuses a write at src/billing/invoice.ts while it stands.\r\n“Keep money as integer cents” — refuses a write at src/billing · \r\n01a11199-abe7-7000-9ba2-7ecd7f9fec37 · accepted by mnid:bda02b63 (a person)\r\nThe rule opens with `mnema show 01a11199-abe7-7000-9ba2-7ecd7f9fec37`; changing it is a \r\ndecision for whoever recorded it.\r\n"]
[23.24181, "o", "\u001b[2m# the refusal is a signed fact of the record, like the rule it cites\u001b[0m\r\n"]
