[25.004782, "o", "public: local integrity verified (T1/T2/T4); 1 tail(s); all events are signature-covered; 1 \r\nbackup key(s), which sign nothing until restored (see census — informational, not a break); \r\nexternal witness (T3): not covered — nothing outside this machine attests this record\r\n"]
